==Polish==

===Etymology===
Until XVII c. it was used a feminine collective noun. From ''[[mąż]]'' + collective suffix [[-czyzna]], from {{proto|Slavic|mǫžь|lang=pl}} < {{proto|Slavic|mon-g-|lang=pl}} < {{proto|Indo-European|man-|lang=pl}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[mɛ̃ˈʂt͡ʂɨz̪n̪a]|lang=pl}}
* {{audio|pl-mężczyzna.ogg|audio}}

===Noun===
{{head|pl|noun|g=m}}

# [[man]], [[male]]

